title AI Multi-Agent Code Review Platform on Kubernetes (AWS EKS)

Developer [icon: user]
Tech Lead [icon: user]
Engineering Manager [icon: user]

CLI Tool [icon: terminal]
Web Dashboard [icon: browser]

GitHub [icon: github]
Claude API [icon: sparkles]
Slack [icon: slack]

Route53 [icon: aws-route-53]
CloudFront [icon: aws-cloudfront]

AWS Cloud [icon: aws-cloud] {

  VPC [icon: aws-vpc] {

    Public Subnet [icon: aws-subnet] {

      Internet Gateway [icon: aws-internet-gateway]

      Application Load Balancer [icon: aws-application-load-balancer]

      NAT Gateway [icon: aws-nat-gateway]

    }

    Private Subnet [icon: aws-subnet] {

      Amazon EKS Cluster [icon: aws-eks] {

        Ingress Controller [icon: kubernetes]

        Frontend Pod (Next.js) [icon: kubernetes]
        API Gateway Pod [icon: kubernetes]

        Review Service Pod [icon: kubernetes]
        Auth Service Pod [icon: kubernetes]
        Notification Service Pod [icon: kubernetes]

        AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) [icon: kubernetes]

        Discovery Agent Pod [icon: robot]
        Security Agent Pod [icon: shield]
        Performance Agent Pod [icon: gauge]
        Test Coverage Agent Pod [icon: flask-conical]
        Architecture Agent Pod [icon: building]
        Readability Agent Pod [icon: file-text]
        Summary Agent Pod [icon: scroll-text]
        Feedback Agent Pod [icon: message-circle]

      }

      RabbitMQ Cluster [icon: aws-amazon-mq]

      Redis Cache [icon: aws-elasticache]

      PostgreSQL Database [icon: aws-rds]

      S3 Report Storage [icon: aws-s3]

    }

    Monitoring Stack [icon: aws-cloudwatch]

    Prometheus [icon: kubernetes]

    Grafana [icon: grafana]

    ECR Container Registry [icon: aws-ecr]

    GitHub Actions CI/CD [icon: github]

  }

}

Developer > CLI Tool
Tech Lead > Web Dashboard
Engineering Manager > Web Dashboard

CLI Tool > Application Load Balancer
Web Dashboard > CloudFront

Route53 > CloudFront
CloudFront > Application Load Balancer

Application Load Balancer > Ingress Controller

Ingress Controller > Frontend Pod (Next.js)
Ingress Controller > API Gateway Pod

API Gateway Pod > Auth Service Pod
API Gateway Pod > Review Service Pod
API Gateway Pod > Notification Service Pod

Auth Service Pod > GitHub

Review Service Pod > GitHub

Review Service Pod > RabbitMQ Cluster

RabbitMQ Cluster > AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph)

AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Discovery Agent Pod
AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Security Agent Pod
AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Performance Agent Pod
AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Test Coverage Agent Pod
AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Architecture Agent Pod
AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Readability Agent Pod
AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Summary Agent Pod
AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Feedback Agent Pod

AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Claude API

AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Redis Cache

Review Service Pod > PostgreSQL Database
Auth Service Pod > PostgreSQL Database
Notification Service Pod > PostgreSQL Database

Review Service Pod > S3 Report Storage

Notification Service Pod > Slack

Frontend Pod (Next.js) > Monitoring Stack
API Gateway Pod > Monitoring Stack
Review Service Pod > Monitoring Stack
Auth Service Pod > Monitoring Stack
Notification Service Pod > Monitoring Stack
AI Orchestrator Pod (LangGraph) > Monitoring Stack

Prometheus > Grafana

GitHub Actions CI/CD > ECR Container Registry

